# Project Governance & Agent Contracts

Strictly follow all rules and procedures defined in `@CLAUDE.md`.

## Execution Rules

1. Before declaring any code/SOW task finished or submitting a commit, run:
   `make verify` (or `zeo` / `zeo` on the changed paths).
2. Never bypass a failing gate or ignore `zeo` / `zeo` warnings/errors.
3. Obey SOW frontmatter rules (`schema_rev: 17`, `status:`, `restaufwand:`, `done_when:`).
4. Do not mutate historical SOW bodies or closed rulings.
